    that declared that attack. If a monster is banished face-up (except during the
    Damage Step): You can banish this card from your field or GY; Special Summon
    1 LIGHT Spellcaster monster from your hand or GY whose ATK equals its own DEF.
    You can only use this effect of "The Golden Swordsoul" once per turn.'
